{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202609/t20260915_1417738.shtml","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:10.744244+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202609/t20260915_1417738.shtml","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<h2>武汉理工大学材料科学与工程学院2027年推荐免试攻读硕士学位（直接攻读博士学位）研究生招生简章</h2>\n<p>发布时间：2026-09-15</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><p><span><strong>一、申请条件</strong></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>符合学校规定的推免生申请基本条件。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>本科期间学习成绩优良、品德表现良好，无违纪处分记录。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>能取得就读高校推荐免试资格的</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>入学前须取得本科毕业证书和学士学位证书。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>申请直接攻读博士学位者，应具有较强的科研创新能力和培养潜力</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>二、招生类别和招生人数</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>（一）本科直博生</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/7a829d1ded4197cc09fb.png\" title=\"\"/></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>注：本科直博生实际招生人数可根据生源情况做适当调整。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（二）硕士研究生</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/dca5c40745fefc9b2e81.png\" title=\"\"/></span></span></p><p><span><span>注：硕士研究生实际招生人数可根据生源情况做适当调整。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、申请、复试、录取工作安排</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>学院成立推免生复试专家组，坚持公平、公正、公开原则，落实集体议事和集体决策制度，以提高选拔质量为核心，坚持全面考查、突出能力考核，强化对考生科研创新潜质和专业能力倾向的考查。复试专家组负责审核考生申请材料，确定复试名单，并根据复试成绩，结合申请材料和综合素质考核结果，对考生进行综合评价，择优录取。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（一）预报名环节</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>我院组织开展预报名，请有意报考我院的推免生及时报名。具体</span></span></span><span><span><span>安排</span></span></span><span><span><span>如下：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span>预报名时间：</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>日至</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>:00</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span>预报名链接：</span></span><span><span><span>http://whlg.form.360eol.com/enroll/325ECNR3</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>预报名材料</span></span></p><p><span><span>考生须将以下材料按顺序扫描为电子版，合并为一个</span></span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span>文件上传预报名系统，文件命名格式为：学生姓名</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>联系方式</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>所在学校。</span></span></p><p><span><span>材料清单如下：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）<strong>推免资格证明（公示文件或截图，须标注本人姓名）</strong>；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）教育部学信网学籍验证报告；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）本科成绩单（加盖学校或院系公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>）外语水平成绩单或证明（大学英语四级、六级、托福、雅思、</span></span><span><span>PETS</span></span><span><span>等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>）学术科研成果及综合能力佐证材料（公开发表论文、授权发明专利、校级及以上获奖证书等）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>考核安排</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>我院审核考生材料后，通知符合条件的考生参加考核。预计采用线上面试</span></span></span><span><span><span>的</span></span></span><span><span><span>方式，设考生自述、专家提问两个环节，主要考查考生</span></span></span><span><span><span>的</span></span></span><span><span><span>知识结构、综合能力和科学素养等。具体时间、方式以面试通知为准，请考生保持手机、邮箱等联系方式畅通。面试结束后，学院将通过电子邮件向通过考核的考生择优发放预录取通知。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span>（二）正式报名与复试</span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>21</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>9:00</span></span><span><span>，推免生开始报名。考生登录中国研究生招生信息网</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开暨管理服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>（以下简称</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>，网址：</span></span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></span><span><span>）填报志愿。原则上，报名截止时间为</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>21</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span>16</span></span><span><span>:00</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>22</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span>，学院通过</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>向符合条件的考生发放复试通知。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>特别提醒：</span></span></span><span><span><span>参加我院预报名并通过考核的考生，务必在规定时间内填报</span></span></span><span><span><span>我院</span></span></span><span><span><span>志愿</span></span></span><span><span><span>、接受</span></span></span><span><span><span>我院复试通知。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span>（三）录取</span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>在“</span></span></span><span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”该环节开启时</span></span></span><span><span><span>，学院开始发放待录取通知。学院根据考核成绩，向参加复试且考核合格的考生发放待录取通知。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>在“</span></span></span><span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”该环节开启时</span></span></span><span><span><span>，考生开始确认待录取通知。学院按照考生确认待录取的时间顺序确定接收名单，额满为止。逾期未确认的，不再保留拟录取名额。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span>学院通过</span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>发放复试通知或待录取通知后，考生须在规定时间内登录系统确认。逾期未确认的，经学院电话联系确认后，学院可按规定撤回相应通知。考生接受待录取通知后，原则上不得更改。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span>预报名考生录取工作结束后，如招生计划仍有余额，学院将根据</span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>中的报名情况，并对考生进行电话复试考核，择优录取。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>四、注意事项</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span>所有推免生（含硕士生、直博生）均须通过</span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>完成报名、复试确认和待录取确认等程序。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>考生须准确填写个人信息，并在推免工作期间保持电话畅通、电子邮箱使用正常，并按要求参加复试考核。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>考生须对提交材料的真实性负责。凡弄虚作假者，一经查实，取消其复试或录取资格。</span></span></p><p><a href=\"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202609/t20260915_1417738.shtml\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span>考生须按照教育部有关规定，</span></span><span><span><span>及时</span></span></span><span><span><span>登录</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>完成网上报名及报名费缴纳。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>五、联系方式</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>联系人：陈老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span></span><span><span>027-87164677</span></span></p><p><span><span>监督电话：</span></span><span><span>027-87651779</span></span></p><p><span><span>地址：湖北省武汉市洪山区珞狮路</span></span><span><span>122</span></span><span><span>号武汉理工大学马房山校区西院材料科学与工程学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮编：</span></span><span><span>430070</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>武汉理工大学材料科学与工程学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>1</span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"20900124e30a9ca90b45a40ad5419246a9c30d93bcaebb695c3f08565d3183ed","textLength":1751,"sourceSha256":"2e17222d7838f20c03210a1810aa22dddfb3d5b876913c97159c8996f9bc92c4","selector":"article-like:list_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a59b834f1867c2ed893e","title":"2026年武汉理工大学材料科学与工程学院2027年推荐免试攻读硕士学位（直接攻读博士学位）研究生招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:10.744244+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202609/W020260915701606116910.png","file":"assets/articles/media/7a829d1ded4197cc09fb.png"},{"sourceUrl":"http://smse.whut.edu.cn/yjspy/zsdt/202609/W020260915701606111705.png","file":"assets/articles/media/dca5c40745fefc9b2e81.png"}]}
